{"id":"252b3ac660c37aa7","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-closed-subset.md","title":"ZFC Closed Subset","display":"df-zfc-closed-subset — ZFC Closed Subset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-closed-subset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-closed-subset"],"display":"df-zfc-closed-subset — ZFC Closed Subset","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-closed-subset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-closed-subset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-closed-subset — ZFC Closed Subset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(A,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedSubset}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ClosedSubset}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}closed\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ClosedSubset}_S(A,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land A\\subseteq\\kappa\\land \\forall \\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;\\Bigl((\\lambda\\neq0\\land\\bigcup(A\\cap\\lambda)=\\lambda)\\to \\lambda\\in A\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}closed\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ClosedSubset}_S(A,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land A\\subseteq\\kappa\\land \\forall \\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;\\Bigl((\\lambda\\neq0\\land\\bigcup(A\\cap\\lambda)=\\lambda)\\to \\lambda\\in A\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is ordinal closedness, not topological closedness; the ordinal predicate now comes from its actual source instead of unrelated <code>closed</code> and <code>subset</code> atoms.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ (ordinal predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClosedSubset}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}closed\\text{-}subset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ClosedSubset}_S(A,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\land A\\subseteq\\kappa\\land \\forall \\lambda\\in\\kappa\\;\\Bigl((\\lambda\\neq0\\land\\bigcup(A\\cap\\lambda)=\\lambda)\\to \\lambda\\in A\\Bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":927,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1622","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-closed-subset.md|58-df-zfc-closed-subset]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5582a281f15a33c2"]}